   "source": [
    "Severity alone does not guarantee faster closure. Where Critical events show long-tail CAPA duration, it suggests governance friction (approvals/vendor dependency) and potential systemic fatigue in high-impact corrective workflows.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Executive Risk Implication:**\n",
    "\n",
    "* Misaligned resolution prioritization\n",
    "\n",
    "* Approval bottlenecks for high-severity cases\n",
    "\n",
    "* Resource allocation distortion\n",
    "\n",
    "**Recommended Action:**\n",
    "\n",
    "* Validate escalation workflow for Critical events\n",
    "\n",
    "* Review approval chain length for engineering CAPAs"
   ]
  },
