    "The Early Warning Index highlights facilities where systemic friction (slow CAPA resolution), recurrence, and severity intensity converge. This provides a preventative prioritization tool for regional leadership before formal audit failure or customer escalation occurs.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Why This Matters for Regional Leadership:**\n",
    "\n",
    "* Preventative allocation of audit resources\n",
    "\n",
    "* Targeted site reviews before failure\n",
    "\n",
    "* Capital planning signal"
   ]
