   "source": [
    "Facilities with prolonged reporting delay present elevated governance risk. When reporting latency increases, CAPA velocity and repeat-rate metrics may falsely indicate improvement due to delayed event visibility rather than operational stability.  This thus becomes a governance issue."
   ]
  },
